\f2\b\fs28 \cf0 1. Retrieve the First 5 Menu Items\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Query
\f1\b0 : List the first 5 menu items from the 
\f4\fs26 \strokec2 menu_items
\f1\fs24 \strokec2  table.\
