\f2\b\fs28 \cf0 2. Skip the First 10 Items and Retrieve the Next 5\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Query
\f1\b0 : List 5 menu items, skipping the first 10 items.\
